From: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: [PATCH] rogue: log GetMultiCoreInfo bridge failures with hook state

0020 已确认 RGXInitMultiCoreInfo 成功（dmesg 无错误），但用户态 ICD 的
GetMultiCoreInfo bridge 仍失败（bridge ioctl 返回 0 而 out.eError 非 OK，
strace 证实）。在 PVRSRVGetMultiCoreInfoKM 里把两件事记到 dmesg：
钩子是否为 NULL、非 OK 时的具体错误码和 capsSize——ICD 一调用即出判决。

Signed-off-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 bsp/modules/gpu/img-bxm/linux/rogue_km/services/server/common/srvcore.c | 9 ++++++++-
--- a/bsp/modules/gpu/img-bxm/linux/rogue_km/services/server/common/srvcore.c
+++ b/bsp/modules/gpu/img-bxm/linux/rogue_km/services/server/common/srvcore.c
@@ -1047,6 +1047,14 @@
 	{
 		eError = psDeviceNode->pfnGetMultiCoreInfo(psDeviceNode, ui32CapsSize, pui32NumCores, pui64Caps);
 	}
+	else
+	{
+		PVR_LOG(("GetMultiCoreInfo: pfn hook is NULL (capsSize=%u)", ui32CapsSize));
+	}
+	if (eError != PVRSRV_OK)
+	{
+		PVR_LOG(("GetMultiCoreInfo: returning error %d (capsSize=%u)", eError, ui32CapsSize));
+	}
 	return eError;
 }
 
